      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Chapter 11. Democracy in Korea (한국의 민주주의) - Korean Politics during the Seventies and Eighties (1970~80년대 한국 정치)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Throughout the 1970s and 1980s, Koreans lived under authoritarian governments that tightly restricted freedom of speech, the press, and political assembly.",
          "chunks": [
            {
              "en": "Throughout the 1970s and 1980s,",
              "ko": "1970년대와 1980년대 내내,"
            },
            {
              "en": "Koreans lived under authoritarian governments",
              "ko": "한국인들은 권위주의 정권 아래에서 살았는데,"
            },
            {
              "en": "that tightly restricted freedom of speech,",
              "ko": "표현의 자유와"
            },
            {
              "en": "the press, and political assembly.",
              "ko": "언론, 정치 집회의 자유를 엄격히 제한하던 정권이었습니다."
            }
          ],
          "words": [
            {
