        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Many people who believed in democracy, including students, workers, and journalists, were arrested, imprisoned, or even tortured for speaking out.",
          "chunks": [
            {
              "en": "Many people who believed in democracy,",
              "ko": "민주주의를 믿었던 많은 사람들이,"
            },
            {
              "en": "including students, workers, and journalists,",
              "ko": "학생, 노동자, 기자들을 비롯해,"
            },
            {
              "en": "were arrested, imprisoned, or even tortured",
              "ko": "체포되고 투옥되거나 심지어 고문을 당했습니다"
            },
            {
              "en": "for speaking out.",
              "ko": "목소리를 냈다는 이유로."
            }
          ],
          "words": [
            {
              "word": "imprison",
              "say": "imprison",
              "meaning": "투옥하다",
              "pos": "동사",
              "start": 100,
              "end": 110,
              "choices": [
                "tortured",
                "restricted",
                "showcase"
              ]
            },
            {
              "word": "torture",
              "say": "torture",
              "meaning": "고문하다",
              "pos": "동사",
              "start": 120,
              "end": 128,
              "choices": [
                "restricted",
                "imprisoned",
                "showcase"
              ]
            },
            {
              "word": "speak out",
              "say": "speak out",
              "meaning": "공개적으로 목소리를 내다",
              "pos": "구동사",
              "start": 133,
              "end": 145,
              "choices": [
                "strive for",
                "holding them to",
                "repression"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "The 광주 Uprising of May 1980, in which hundreds of citizens were killed by troops, remains one of the most painful chapters in modern Korean history.",
          "chunks": [
            {
              "en": "The 광주 Uprising of May 1980,",
              "ko": "1980년 5월의 광주 민주화 운동은,"
            },
            {
              "en": "in which hundreds of citizens were killed by troops,",
              "ko": "수백 명의 시민이 군인들에게 목숨을 잃은,"
            },
            {
              "en": "remains one of the most painful chapters",
              "ko": "가장 고통스러운 장 중 하나로 남아 있습니다"
            },
            {
              "en": "in modern Korean history.",
              "ko": "한국 현대사에서."
            }
          ],
          "words": [
            {
              "word": "uprising",
              "say": "uprising",
              "meaning": "봉기, 민중 항쟁",
              "pos": "명사",
              "start": 7,
              "end": 15,
              "choices": [
                "repression",
                "direct presidential elections",
                "political scientists"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Even after the worst of the repression had passed, countless dedicated citizens continued to strive for a democracy that would truly belong to the people.",
          "chunks": [
            {
              "en": "Even after the worst of the repression had passed,",
              "ko": "가장 혹독한 탄압의 시기가 지난 뒤에도,"
            },
            {
              "en": "countless dedicated citizens continued to strive",
              "ko": "수많은 헌신적인 시민들은 계속 분투했습니다"
            },
            {
              "en": "for a democracy that would truly belong to the people.",
              "ko": "진정으로 국민의 것이 될 민주주의를 위해."
            }
          ],
          "words": [
            {
              "word": "repression",
              "say": "repression",
              "meaning": "탄압, 억압",
              "pos": "명사",
              "start": 28,
              "end": 38,
              "choices": [
                "voter turnout",
                "fate",
                "freedom of speech"
              ]
            },
            {
